-- Vincent's second "继续深化" (2026-09-14) had no new source document attached,
-- following his first "可以继续深化" -- read as explicit authorization to
-- enrich the remaining thin service_pricing rows using general Singapore
-- Companies Act / ACRA regulatory knowledge where confident, rather than
-- waiting further for internal source material. Every row touched here
-- gets its remarks_en/remarks_cn appended with an explicit
-- "GENERAL KNOWLEDGE, NOT TASSURE-VERIFIED" label, distinct from every
