UPDATE public.service_pricing
SET description_en = COALESCE(description_en, '') || E'\n\n' || 'General process: an Extraordinary General Meeting is convened (with proper notice to shareholders) to obtain shareholder approval for a specific matter outside the routine AGM business -- e.g. approving the company giving security/guarantees for bank facilities, or approving a major investment. Certain transactions (such as giving financial assistance for the acquisition of the company''s own shares) are subject to specific restrictions/exceptions under the Companies Act and may need legal input before the EGM is called.',
    description_cn = COALESCE(description_cn, '') || E'\n\n' || '一般流程：召开特别股东大会（须依规定向股东发出通知），就常规年度股东大会业务范围以外的特定事项取得股东批准——例如批准公司为银行融资提供担保/抵押，或批准一项重大投资。某些交易（如为收购公司自身股份提供财务资助）受《公司法》特定限制/豁免条款约束，召开EGM前可能需要先取得法律意见。',
