UPDATE public.service_pricing
SET description_en = COALESCE(description_en, '') || E'\n\n' || 'General scope: this covers an UPDATE lodgment to the Register of Registrable Controllers (RORC) after the initial one -- e.g. when a controller/UBO changes -- as distinct from the very first RORC filing due within 30 days of incorporation (see the Company Incorporation Service row). Any change to the company''s controllers must be updated in the register within the statutory timeframe.',
    description_cn = COALESCE(description_cn, '') || E'\n\n' || '一般范围：这是指实际控制人登记册（RORC）在最初申报之后的更新申报——例如控制人/最终实益拥有人发生变化时——区别于公司成立后30天内的首次RORC申报（详见"公司注册服务"一行）。公司控制人一旦发生变化，须在法定期限内更新登记册。',
